            <div xml:id="d787">

                <pb facs="1002" n="888" xml:id="pg888"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/173: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schuyler</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-08T10:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1922—10
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 12:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>62. Has Department approved terms of loan contract as finally signed by Keith and
                    Keilhauer on June 24th and received here yesterday? It is to be presented to the
                    Congress on Monday for approval.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schuyler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
